WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.220 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 29]

01:41.400 --> 01:42.770
Where did you guys hit it off at first sight?

01:44.920 --> 01:45.900
At the Pleasure House, of course.

01:46.510 --> 01:47.690
The place was full of drunks.

01:47.790 --> 01:49.540
Only Mr. Su and I kept our cool.

01:53.640 --> 01:54.210
I'll take my leave.

01:56.120 --> 01:56.570
Let's go.

01:59.150 --> 02:00.100
Take care, Mr. Su.

02:04.790 --> 02:05.770
Prince of Langya...

02:16.840 --> 02:19.220
After dark,

02:19.750 --> 02:21.660
Tianqi City is easier on the eyes than by day.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.730
You don't like Tianqi City?

02:26.910 --> 02:27.450
I don't.

02:27.590 --> 02:28.780
It's too big here.

02:29.430 --> 02:30.240
The houses are big.

02:30.240 --> 02:31.060
The streets are wide.

02:31.190 --> 02:31.940
Even the food is big.

02:32.430 --> 02:33.980
An osmanthus cake

02:34.150 --> 02:35.450
is the size of a brick!

02:36.310 --> 02:37.200
Does a bigger cake

02:37.260 --> 02:38.660
mean better taste?

02:40.080 --> 02:41.450
Nan'an...

02:41.680 --> 02:43.100
Nan'an...

02:43.590 --> 02:45.380
I want to go back to Nan'an...

02:46.840 --> 02:48.100
We shouldn't stay long.

02:51.080 --> 02:51.940
Oh, Su Muyu,

02:52.680 --> 02:54.180
now that we're in Tianqi City,

02:54.630 --> 02:56.500
shouldn't we keep a low profile?

02:57.000 --> 02:57.850
Opening a clinic here

02:58.030 --> 02:59.290
pretty much tells everyone

02:59.590 --> 03:00.380
we're right here.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.430
Why can't Blood River

03:03.000 --> 03:03.890
enter Tianqi City?

03:04.680 --> 03:06.820
It's just a sect in the imperial city.

03:07.910 --> 03:08.940
We'll tell everyone

03:09.630 --> 03:10.410
we're here.

03:11.470 --> 03:12.410
Every move we make

03:13.080 --> 03:14.540
can stand in the open.

03:15.430 --> 03:16.260
What's there to fear?

03:17.280 --> 03:17.980
Exactly!

03:23.360 --> 03:23.980
What is it?

03:30.080 --> 03:31.410
Is it that snake from the Medicine King?

03:35.360 --> 03:35.980
Yes.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.610
Baicao gave me this one.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.690
It's paired with the one Night Crow keeps,

03:41.000 --> 03:41.940
life-and-death linked.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.260
When they get close,

03:43.630 --> 03:44.450
they react.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.450
So, Night Crow is nearby.

03:47.400 --> 03:48.100
You should head back to the inn.

03:48.470 --> 03:49.130
I'll go take a look.

03:49.710 --> 03:51.220
My martial niece is vicious,

03:51.520 --> 03:52.690
and good at every dirty trick!

03:53.280 --> 03:54.060
I'll go with you.

03:59.310 --> 04:00.280
No need to worry.

04:00.470 --> 04:01.570
I'll go with Muyu.

04:02.310 --> 04:02.730
All right.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.540
Then be extra careful.

04:04.910 --> 04:05.660
Don't worry.

04:21.510 --> 04:22.100
Yumo,

04:23.070 --> 04:23.930
weren't you staying at the inn

04:24.120 --> 04:25.050
with Changhe?

04:25.800 --> 04:26.490
Why are you here?

04:27.950 --> 04:28.730
Among those people,

04:29.630 --> 04:30.540
one was Tang Lianyue.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.170
So,

04:33.120 --> 04:34.810
you were tailing Tang Lianyue first?

04:35.600 --> 04:36.220
Quit asking.

04:36.430 --> 04:36.980
Let's move.

04:41.830 --> 04:42.860
Remove the puppet poison

04:42.860 --> 04:43.900
from my senior,

04:44.800 --> 04:46.370
or you won't leave alive!

04:47.560 --> 04:48.140
Oh, really?

04:53.510 --> 04:54.170
Master Su.

04:56.040 --> 04:57.370
Seems someone can't see me.

04:59.240 --> 04:59.700
Miss Mu.

05:01.000 --> 05:01.660
Xuanwu Guardian,

05:02.750 --> 05:03.810
you're in trouble now.

05:07.000 --> 05:07.730
Master Su,

05:08.560 --> 05:09.700
I expect you to lend me a hand.

05:10.920 --> 05:11.850
Looks like tonight,

05:12.240 --> 05:14.140
I've got two fine whetstones.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.410
Ghost Physician Night Crow,

05:17.040 --> 05:17.540
I don't like

05:17.750 --> 05:19.170
this Tang clan prodigy next to you,

05:19.950 --> 05:20.900
but I like you even less,

05:21.160 --> 05:21.930
someone who toys

05:22.120 --> 05:22.900
with people's lives.

05:23.430 --> 05:24.220
The miracle physician said,

05:24.750 --> 05:26.050
if we ever meet you,

05:26.680 --> 05:27.810
I should kill you, traitor,

05:28.040 --> 05:29.170
for the Medicine King Valley.

05:30.480 --> 05:31.290
Seems you do heed

05:31.310 --> 05:32.660
my senior.

05:33.360 --> 05:34.780
But taking my life

05:35.040 --> 05:36.250
won't be that easy.

05:36.510 --> 05:37.170
Go!

05:47.070 --> 05:47.700
Who is he?

05:48.360 --> 05:49.370
He's the Tang clan's deputy master,

05:49.720 --> 05:50.370
Tang Linghuang.

05:52.160 --> 05:52.780
Master Su,

05:53.310 --> 05:54.370
if you help me save my senior,

05:54.720 --> 05:55.220
I will remember

05:55.630 --> 05:56.580
this favor for life.

05:57.310 --> 05:57.980
Favor?

05:58.830 --> 05:59.460
To repay it,

05:59.830 --> 06:00.980
you'd do anything?

06:03.430 --> 06:04.290
So long as it doesn't cross the line.

06:04.800 --> 06:05.660
Save it.

06:06.750 --> 06:07.580
Die!

06:29.830 --> 06:30.370
That was "Tide Rising"

06:30.830 --> 06:31.340
from the Springwater Sword.

06:31.750 --> 06:32.220
Muyu,

06:32.560 --> 06:33.610
why not use the Eighteen-Sword Array?

06:34.270 --> 06:35.410
Tang Lianyue wants him saved,

06:35.870 --> 06:36.730
not dead.

06:37.070 --> 06:38.660
The Eighteen-Sword Array kills.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.490
It can't save.

06:40.630 --> 06:41.050
Yumo,

06:41.310 --> 06:42.250
trap Night Crow first.

06:42.680 --> 06:43.460
Thousand-Spider Array,

06:44.950 --> 06:45.410
activate!

06:58.630 --> 06:59.340
Darn it!

07:19.040 --> 07:20.540
My senior never learned Poison-Sand Palm.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.290
It's poison drawn off Xuewei.

07:29.870 --> 07:30.490
Fine.

07:31.310 --> 07:32.140
It was just a test

07:32.310 --> 07:33.700
of this Gold-Body Puppet's power.

07:34.630 --> 07:35.140
That's enough fun

07:35.630 --> 07:36.900
for tonight.

07:37.190 --> 07:37.810
Let's go!

07:39.480 --> 07:39.930
Don't run!

07:43.270 --> 07:43.730
Senior!

08:07.270 --> 08:08.660
Thanks to Miss Bai's snake.

08:10.160 --> 08:10.730
Darn it.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.100
You learned it just now.

08:16.830 --> 08:18.370
Even if you find Night Crow,

08:19.120 --> 08:20.380
you still can't

08:20.380 --> 08:21.660
save your senior from her.

08:27.120 --> 08:28.540
What did they do to my senior?

08:29.630 --> 08:30.540
One thing you can trust.

08:31.270 --> 08:31.900
As a Gold-Body Puppet,

08:32.270 --> 08:33.420
he's still alive,

08:33.910 --> 08:35.130
just unconscious.

08:35.720 --> 08:36.580
His martial skill

08:36.600 --> 08:37.340
will even improve.

08:38.870 --> 08:39.810
If I'm right,

08:40.440 --> 08:42.060
though he's your senior,

08:42.360 --> 08:43.850
and much older,

08:44.440 --> 08:45.330
the two of you

08:45.330 --> 08:46.770
are roughly equals.

08:48.030 --> 08:48.770
But just now,

08:49.510 --> 08:50.370
he took on two of us

08:51.000 --> 08:51.940
and had the upper hand.

08:54.480 --> 08:56.250
So how do we break the puppet poison?

08:57.270 --> 08:57.770
I don't know.

08:58.080 --> 08:58.850
You don't?

08:59.510 --> 09:00.220
I only know

09:01.040 --> 09:02.850
there's just one way to kill a drugged puppet:

09:03.550 --> 09:04.340
pierce the heart

09:04.790 --> 09:06.180
and grind it to pulp.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.790
I know you're anxious,

09:10.280 --> 09:11.970
but your senior's life

09:11.970 --> 09:13.460
is in others' hands.

09:14.120 --> 09:14.940
We can only wait.

09:17.440 --> 09:18.650
We'll meet again soon.

09:21.020 --> 09:21.650
Yumo,

09:22.200 --> 09:22.850
let's go.

09:40.030 --> 09:40.580
Master,

09:41.120 --> 09:42.370
why don't you go in and sleep?

09:42.670 --> 09:44.010
Changhe and I will wait here.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.060
I'm uneasy.

09:48.320 --> 09:49.010
I can't sleep.

09:50.840 --> 09:51.490
Miracle physician...

09:53.440 --> 09:54.180
Bored of waiting?

09:54.670 --> 09:55.580
I'll do a trick for you.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.490
What trick?

10:02.600 --> 10:03.130
Hand it here.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.940
Wow, that's an eye-opener!

10:37.030 --> 10:38.010
Just a parlor trick.

10:50.870 --> 10:51.460
You're back.

10:53.120 --> 10:53.730
Yeah.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.610
You look a bit worse for wear.

10:57.270 --> 10:58.220
What master did you run into?

10:59.510 --> 11:00.060
Tang Linghuang

11:00.750 --> 11:01.370
of the Tang clan.

11:02.440 --> 11:04.010
Oh, the future grand master of the Tang clan.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.010
He finally showed himself.

11:06.720 --> 11:07.770
He's a tough one.

11:08.870 --> 11:09.490
Still,

11:10.030 --> 11:11.130
why would he attack you?

11:12.910 --> 11:13.850
He was turned into a drugged puppet.

11:14.150 --> 11:14.700
What?

11:15.030 --> 11:16.530
Tang Linghuang was made a drugged puppet?

11:16.840 --> 11:17.930
A Heaven-level master

11:18.000 --> 11:19.100
was made into a puppet...

11:19.840 --> 11:20.490
She really created

11:20.870 --> 11:22.300
the perfect Gold-Body Puppet

11:22.550 --> 11:23.980
of legend!

11:30.080 --> 11:31.340
Li Xinyue has agreed

11:31.370 --> 11:32.420
to reach Prince of Langya for us.

11:32.870 --> 11:33.460
Do you think

11:33.720 --> 11:34.700
he'll work with us?

11:36.000 --> 11:37.610
He should hate us after all.

11:38.200 --> 11:39.610
He founded the Inner Security Division

11:39.870 --> 11:41.820
because he thinks the Shadow Sect should not exist.

11:42.550 --> 11:44.580
He likes things out in the open.

11:45.000 --> 11:45.850
But we...

11:46.360 --> 11:47.610
don't really fit that.

11:50.510 --> 11:52.220
We're not the old Blood River anymore.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.220
He will come meet us.

11:56.600 --> 11:58.530
People's bias is hard to uproot.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.460
You're that sure?

12:02.750 --> 12:03.490
He's Prince of Langya.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.490
If he sees like the crowd,

12:07.630 --> 12:08.470
that means

12:08.470 --> 12:10.220
we chose the wrong partner.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.700
Then let Blood River's tide

12:25.960 --> 12:27.580
truly surge into Tianqi.

12:51.600 --> 12:52.890
Why are you two here so early today?

12:53.320 --> 12:54.250
We've got urgent business to report!

12:58.670 --> 13:00.010
You look even more pressed.

13:00.360 --> 13:00.980
You go first.

13:01.750 --> 13:03.100
I found my senior's trail last night.

13:03.720 --> 13:05.180
He's under the ghost physician Night Crow,

13:05.630 --> 13:06.730
already forged into a puppet,

13:07.150 --> 13:08.220
hiding in Tianqi City.

13:08.670 --> 13:09.180
Yesterday,

13:09.390 --> 13:10.220
Master Su and I

13:10.840 --> 13:11.700
tried together to save him.

13:12.360 --> 13:13.890
But as a puppet now,

13:14.200 --> 13:15.130
his strength was too great.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.530
He got away in the end.

13:17.080 --> 13:17.490
Wait.

13:18.150 --> 13:19.220
Master Su?

13:19.840 --> 13:20.650
The Umbrella Ghost?

13:22.630 --> 13:23.820
That's why I'm here.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.540
[Loyal and Dutiful]
Blood River Patriarch

13:25.600 --> 13:26.730
and the three current family heads

13:27.200 --> 13:28.530
brought a squad of Blood River elites

13:28.840 --> 13:30.010
into Tianqi City together.

13:30.630 --> 13:31.340
But,

13:31.870 --> 13:33.580
they haven't tried to hide it.

13:34.270 --> 13:34.730
Yesterday,

13:34.960 --> 13:35.850
I found them.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.460
They said

13:39.320 --> 13:39.940
they want to meet you.

13:41.960 --> 13:42.940
Blood River

13:43.270 --> 13:44.890
has been tangled with me

13:45.360 --> 13:46.980
since the late emperor's time.

13:48.270 --> 13:49.340
What do they want with me?

13:50.320 --> 13:52.770
They say they want to work with you.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.060
Last time they came to Tianqi,

13:56.630 --> 13:57.700
one of them told me

13:58.150 --> 13:59.130
they'd build

13:59.270 --> 14:00.220
a new Blood River.

14:02.120 --> 14:02.850
What do you think?

14:05.360 --> 14:06.010
Best not to meet them.

14:06.720 --> 14:08.890
Rumors are flying in Tianqi City.

14:09.550 --> 14:10.460
If it gets out

14:10.720 --> 14:11.980
Prince of Langya met Blood River in secret,

14:12.790 --> 14:14.220
it will be a headache.

14:17.120 --> 14:17.490
Lianyue,

14:18.600 --> 14:19.420
what do you think?

14:22.550 --> 14:23.220
I think

14:24.000 --> 14:24.940
they mean no harm.

14:28.670 --> 14:29.220
Let's meet them, then.

14:30.780 --> 14:31.900
[Three days later, meet at Fengxue Tower]

14:35.720 --> 14:36.720
Three days from now,

14:37.600 --> 14:38.180
he'll meet us at Fengxue Tower.

14:38.510 --> 14:40.620
That's the big restaurant in the south of Tianqi!

14:41.030 --> 14:42.800
I hear their steamed fish is great.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.850
Naturally, you're coming too.

14:46.030 --> 14:47.300
I'm not with Blood River.

14:47.870 --> 14:48.770
You're there to talk business.

14:49.030 --> 14:49.730
What's the point of me going?

14:50.960 --> 14:51.770
Eating fish, of course.

14:54.000 --> 14:54.580
Oh, right.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.730
I'm in then.

15:02.030 --> 15:03.420
But this should be a secret meeting.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.420
Why did he pick

15:05.510 --> 15:06.460
a restaurant?

15:07.720 --> 15:09.340
Maybe because he's Prince of Langya,

15:09.480 --> 15:11.490
the most powerful man in Tianqi City.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.850
That's his leverage.

15:14.360 --> 15:14.940
Looks like

15:15.480 --> 15:16.700
we'll be staying

15:16.910 --> 15:17.820
in Tianqi City.

15:18.840 --> 15:19.850
We're invited to the feast

15:20.120 --> 15:21.610
three days from now.

15:21.910 --> 15:22.700
But our clinic opens

15:23.080 --> 15:24.250
the day after tomorrow.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.730
Then we'll open it first.

15:28.670 --> 15:30.180
That way we have a public face

15:30.910 --> 15:31.940
here in Tianqi City.

15:33.720 --> 15:35.850
He-Yu Clinic, Tianqi Branch,

15:36.320 --> 15:37.340
opens the day after tomorrow.

15:38.200 --> 15:39.010
Do you need me?

15:39.320 --> 15:39.980
No!

15:45.150 --> 15:46.130
It's been a while.

15:47.120 --> 15:48.060
Greetings, Your Highness.

15:49.360 --> 15:50.460
I'd like to see

15:51.000 --> 15:52.220
the one you spoke of,

15:52.960 --> 15:54.250
the near-perfect

15:54.390 --> 15:55.340
Gold-Body Puppet.

15:56.150 --> 15:57.420
As you wish.

15:59.000 --> 15:59.610
Halt!

15:59.870 --> 16:00.530
How dare you!

16:03.630 --> 16:04.340
Good!

16:10.150 --> 16:12.010
Night Crow, you've got nerve.

16:13.270 --> 16:13.940
It's fine.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.340
What do you think, Your Highness?

16:16.870 --> 16:18.610
Not like the old drugged puppets,

16:19.000 --> 16:19.820
dull and wooden.

16:20.480 --> 16:22.370
This Gold-Body Puppet is agile,

16:24.200 --> 16:24.940
and...

16:25.960 --> 16:27.460
that punch just now

16:29.200 --> 16:30.650
had the force of a Heaven-level master,

16:31.120 --> 16:32.940
Not a common Heaven-level one.

16:34.670 --> 16:35.820
Your Highness,

16:36.270 --> 16:37.940
who is your strongest guard?

16:38.390 --> 16:39.730
Why ask that out of the blue?

16:40.750 --> 16:42.650
I assume

16:42.670 --> 16:44.650
it's a formidable Heaven-level master.

16:45.080 --> 16:45.940
If you dare,

16:46.550 --> 16:47.610
let him test

16:47.630 --> 16:49.700
my Gold-Body Puppet.

16:50.120 --> 16:51.010
I'm confident

16:51.720 --> 16:52.610
the one who wins

16:52.960 --> 16:55.060
will be this puppet.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.180
May this puppet's power

16:58.240 --> 17:01.180
reach the Spirit-Roam level?

17:01.630 --> 17:02.530
Your Highness's standards

17:03.240 --> 17:04.490
are quite high.

17:16.200 --> 17:17.140
Our target

17:17.750 --> 17:18.620
is Prince of Langya.

17:19.550 --> 17:21.220
He has four guardians,

17:22.270 --> 17:23.010
each one

17:23.790 --> 17:25.860
a Free-Heaven level master.

17:27.270 --> 17:28.290
So, Night Crow,

17:29.350 --> 17:30.250
I expect

17:30.680 --> 17:33.010
an even finer Gold-Body Puppet.

17:34.070 --> 17:35.980
I will not fail.

17:39.070 --> 17:39.620
Master,

17:40.240 --> 17:40.900
did you see

17:41.160 --> 17:41.810
that punch just now?

17:42.270 --> 17:43.170
Do you think

17:43.750 --> 17:44.630
Night Crow's bluffing?

17:45.000 --> 17:46.700
That puppet's body

17:47.880 --> 17:48.830
is Tang Linghuang,

17:48.880 --> 17:50.980
the next grand master of Tang clan.

17:51.790 --> 17:53.730
Its strength

17:55.790 --> 17:57.370
should have touched

17:57.400 --> 17:59.460
the Grand-Free threshold.

18:01.270 --> 18:03.190
Compared to me now,

18:04.240 --> 18:07.420
it's still a step short.

18:11.110 --> 18:12.140
I see.

18:15.070 --> 18:15.730
Master,

18:17.110 --> 18:18.290
if you two join forces,

18:19.510 --> 18:21.140
can you kill Prince of Langya?

18:23.480 --> 18:24.220
Yong,

18:26.790 --> 18:27.860
Is your aim

18:29.160 --> 18:32.180
just to kill Prince of Langya?

18:37.550 --> 18:39.050
He's the biggest obstacle

18:40.200 --> 18:41.250
in our path.

18:41.750 --> 18:43.220
Even if Prince of Langya dies,

18:43.680 --> 18:44.940
His Majesty's favorite

18:44.940 --> 18:46.820
is still the Sixth Prince Xiao Chuhe.

18:46.820 --> 18:49.610
That won't change a bit.

18:50.790 --> 18:51.980
What we must do

18:53.400 --> 18:56.260
is make His Majesty stop trusting Prince of Langya.

18:56.260 --> 18:56.910
And make him

18:56.910 --> 18:58.290
distrust Xiao Chuhe,

18:58.310 --> 19:00.980
Prince of Langya's closest ally.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.090
Only then,

19:03.200 --> 19:05.660
the Dragonseal Scroll

19:05.660 --> 19:07.380
will bear

19:09.070 --> 19:10.620
your name.

19:15.200 --> 19:16.220
I was too hasty, Master.

19:21.030 --> 19:24.010
Return to the palace later tonight.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.250
At Qiushui Cottage,

19:27.240 --> 19:29.140
I've arranged a distinguished guest.

19:29.590 --> 19:31.420
Have a drink with him

19:31.790 --> 19:32.700
before heading back.

19:33.200 --> 19:33.980
A guest?

19:35.920 --> 19:36.860
What kind of guest

19:37.720 --> 19:39.660
worth the word "distinguished"?

19:40.160 --> 19:42.090
Blood River's current leader,

19:42.960 --> 19:43.940
the Patriarch,

19:45.160 --> 19:46.860
Su Changhe.

19:52.750 --> 19:53.860
Well now,

19:55.350 --> 19:56.810
this just got interesting.

20:27.000 --> 20:27.660
What are you looking at?

20:29.200 --> 20:29.810
The mortal world.

20:35.270 --> 20:36.730
I, Blood River's "devil",

20:37.790 --> 20:38.730
am looking at the mortal world.

20:40.960 --> 20:41.490
Changhe,

20:42.590 --> 20:44.530
you seem to have more of that everyday warmth now.

20:47.240 --> 20:48.010
Everyday warmth?

20:56.400 --> 20:57.420
Not really.

20:58.350 --> 20:59.380
If I caught any,

21:00.030 --> 21:01.770
it's from time with you and the miracle physician.

21:05.480 --> 21:06.330
I was just watching

21:06.510 --> 21:07.940
this bustling market

21:08.240 --> 21:09.330
and wondering...

21:10.790 --> 21:11.900
is an ordinary life

21:12.350 --> 21:13.180
meaningful?

21:14.270 --> 21:16.040
No feuds of the jianghu,

21:16.160 --> 21:17.460
no courtly plots,

21:17.960 --> 21:19.280
just ordinary days,

21:19.350 --> 21:21.420
haggling over rice and oil,

21:22.070 --> 21:23.290
living on and on...

21:25.590 --> 21:26.460
It is meaningful.

21:27.640 --> 21:29.090
Everyone lives differently.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.060
A steady life like that

21:31.880 --> 21:33.200
is already a luxury

21:33.240 --> 21:34.810
for many people.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.540
Aren't we fighting

21:36.540 --> 21:38.220
to bring Blood River

21:38.680 --> 21:40.010
back into the light?

21:40.590 --> 21:41.490
So Blood River's all folks,

21:42.240 --> 21:43.010
not just you and me,

21:43.480 --> 21:44.940
can choose other paths.

21:45.750 --> 21:47.090
So they won't be other's blades

21:47.680 --> 21:48.530
or shadows in the dark.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.620
How they live from now on,

21:51.510 --> 21:52.290
how they go on,

21:53.270 --> 21:54.860
is their choice.

21:55.510 --> 21:56.480
If you had a choice,

21:57.030 --> 21:57.700
Changhe,

21:58.350 --> 21:59.090
what would you do?

22:04.270 --> 22:05.050
No "if".

22:06.880 --> 22:07.940
Even without choice,

22:09.310 --> 22:10.530
I'd cut a new path.

22:14.960 --> 22:15.730
Speaking of choices,

22:16.440 --> 22:18.140
do you truly trust Prince of Langya?

22:18.750 --> 22:19.460
Why ask?

22:20.160 --> 22:21.140
If he were so sound,

22:21.830 --> 22:22.700
why end up

22:22.720 --> 22:24.050
in such a bind?

22:25.110 --> 22:26.010
The emperor wary of him.

22:26.270 --> 22:27.380
The princes fearing him.

22:28.590 --> 22:30.290
And he himself walking on eggshells.

22:32.310 --> 22:32.940
If you ask me...

22:35.960 --> 22:36.810
forget it.

22:37.550 --> 22:38.530
You won't like it.

22:39.960 --> 22:41.660
Weren't you buying herbs with the miracle physician?

22:42.050 --> 22:42.900
Go on then.

22:43.310 --> 22:44.490
I'll sit this one out.

22:45.920 --> 22:46.700
I'm done

22:47.000 --> 22:47.810
just watching this world.

22:48.680 --> 22:49.380
I'm going downstairs

22:49.720 --> 22:51.320
to experience it for myself.

22:59.440 --> 23:00.460
Everyone knows

23:00.920 --> 23:02.220
Tianqi's best wine

23:02.220 --> 23:03.090
is at Diaolou Cottage,

23:03.720 --> 23:05.770
their famed Autumn Dew.

23:06.720 --> 23:08.700
This is my first time tasting Autumn Waters

23:09.240 --> 23:10.250
from Qiushui Cottage.

23:12.160 --> 23:14.180
Autumn Dew

23:14.750 --> 23:16.290
is brewed once a month,

23:17.070 --> 23:19.380
and served for only four hours.

23:20.070 --> 23:22.460
But Autumn Waters here

23:22.880 --> 23:24.660
appears only once a year,

23:24.880 --> 23:26.380
for just three days each autumn.

23:26.960 --> 23:28.620
Sir, your timing

23:28.640 --> 23:29.900
is just perfect.

23:31.480 --> 23:32.330
How is it?

23:33.270 --> 23:34.010
I don't drink.

23:40.070 --> 23:40.900
Why not?

23:41.270 --> 23:42.530
Sometimes I can drink all night,

23:42.720 --> 23:43.730
sometimes one sip floors me.

23:44.270 --> 23:45.140
As for wine,

23:45.160 --> 23:46.420
it means nothing special to me.

23:47.200 --> 23:48.140
I'm not like Sikong Changfeng

23:48.200 --> 23:49.660
or Baili Dongjun.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.900
I'm no hard-drinking wanderer.

23:52.720 --> 23:53.570
I'm...

23:55.640 --> 23:56.380
What?

23:58.960 --> 24:00.770
The ferryman to the Other Shore.

24:05.310 --> 24:06.330
What is the Other Shore?

24:10.160 --> 24:10.900
Yong,

24:12.160 --> 24:13.530
don't be so tense.

24:16.160 --> 24:16.660
Sorry.

24:17.550 --> 24:18.050
Master.

24:22.750 --> 24:23.490
Go on, Sir.

24:27.960 --> 24:30.420
His Highness just called you "Master".

24:31.400 --> 24:32.250
I didn't expect that.

24:33.880 --> 24:35.290
I thought your disciples

24:35.310 --> 24:36.380
were only the Five Great Eunuchs.

24:37.790 --> 24:39.420
I entered the palace as a child.

24:39.720 --> 24:40.980
I was frail by birth,

24:42.110 --> 24:44.180
and bullied for years.

24:44.390 --> 24:46.310
Until I was sent to Yongle Palace,

24:46.310 --> 24:47.770
where I met Consort Shu.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.900
At last, someone cared for me.

24:50.110 --> 24:51.090
Consort Shu

24:51.310 --> 24:53.090
was gentle and kind, generous to all.

24:53.440 --> 24:55.380
Seeing my frailty, she urged me to train.

24:55.680 --> 24:57.220
She even brought out

24:57.400 --> 24:59.220
clan manuals for me to study.

25:00.790 --> 25:02.660
Among them was a partial manual

25:03.510 --> 25:05.010
titled "The Humble Heart".

25:05.790 --> 25:07.700
I studied it for years

25:08.480 --> 25:10.770
before grasping this unique art.

25:11.720 --> 25:13.090
Consort Shu...

25:14.000 --> 25:15.010
Is she your mother?

25:17.590 --> 25:18.420
She was consort

25:19.270 --> 25:20.980
to the late Emperor Tai'an,

25:22.350 --> 25:23.420
and my mother's aunt.

25:24.030 --> 25:26.460
Consort Shu had no children.

25:27.880 --> 25:29.140
In her clan,

25:29.480 --> 25:31.460
she was close only

25:31.480 --> 25:32.380
to this niece.

25:33.440 --> 25:35.810
She knew her clan's power

25:35.830 --> 25:36.940
had declined,

25:37.790 --> 25:40.290
so she asked me to watch over Yong.

25:40.640 --> 25:41.530
Sadly,

25:42.200 --> 25:43.530
I was soon assigned to guard

25:43.550 --> 25:44.380
the imperial mausoleum.

25:44.590 --> 25:45.940
I could only slip away at times

25:46.960 --> 25:48.810
to teach him a few arts.

25:51.310 --> 25:53.050
I never thought

25:53.750 --> 25:55.980
you would be so loyal and true,

25:57.880 --> 25:58.900
same as me.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.090
Sir,

26:06.680 --> 26:08.810
you're a fascinating one.

26:11.640 --> 26:12.810
The last time

26:12.830 --> 26:14.220
you came to Tianqi City,

26:14.240 --> 26:14.940
I knew

26:15.240 --> 26:16.250
one day,

26:17.350 --> 26:18.900
we'd be friends

26:20.350 --> 26:21.900
or foes.

26:31.110 --> 26:32.090
Often,

26:33.030 --> 26:33.980
friends or foes

26:34.720 --> 26:35.620
are decided

26:36.550 --> 26:38.050
in a single thought.

26:40.830 --> 26:41.940
Sir Zhuo Qing,

26:42.680 --> 26:44.090
will we be friends?

26:45.070 --> 26:47.220
That depends

26:48.880 --> 26:51.900
on what kind of friend you need.

26:57.310 --> 26:58.250
As I said,

26:59.720 --> 27:01.220
I'm the ferryman to the Other Shore.

27:02.070 --> 27:03.050
And right now...

27:05.160 --> 27:06.900
I need a boat.

27:19.000 --> 27:20.570
No wonder you were once second

27:20.680 --> 27:22.420
only to Mr. Li.

27:23.160 --> 27:24.660
I've seen qi freeze ice,

27:24.680 --> 27:26.290
but never a single glance

27:26.310 --> 27:27.380
freeze water itself.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.490
Su Changhe!

27:31.720 --> 27:33.140
You spoke a name you shouldn't.

27:33.550 --> 27:34.220
Yes?

27:36.350 --> 27:37.220
Yong

27:38.190 --> 27:39.960
is the first prince.

27:41.350 --> 27:43.960
His mother's clan has faded,

27:44.400 --> 27:46.050
but it's still one

27:46.060 --> 27:48.400
of Tianqi's top five houses.

27:49.200 --> 27:50.660
Among the princes,

27:50.920 --> 27:52.200
only a few

27:52.200 --> 27:53.940
are fit to rival him

27:54.200 --> 27:55.900
for the heir-apparent's seat.

28:02.350 --> 28:04.140
Second Prince Xiao Chong

28:05.110 --> 28:06.700
noble-born as well,

28:07.350 --> 28:09.490
was known for his talent since childhood.

28:10.440 --> 28:11.290
Sadly,

28:12.000 --> 28:14.490
he was poisoned years ago,

28:14.490 --> 28:15.470
and remains blind to this day.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.830
No one can cure him.

28:17.440 --> 28:18.930
The Seventh Prince Xiao Yu,

28:19.160 --> 28:21.770
born to His Majesty's favorite consort,

28:23.070 --> 28:24.730
was doted on since youth.

28:26.160 --> 28:28.090
But he's reckless and spoiled.

28:28.880 --> 28:30.900
The Shadow Sect behind him

28:32.790 --> 28:34.770
was wiped out by you.

28:36.270 --> 28:38.980
The only real rival to Yong

28:39.550 --> 28:41.290
is the sixth prince,

28:41.960 --> 28:43.250
Xiao Chuhe.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.460
Behind him stands

28:46.110 --> 28:50.380
Prince of Langya, Xiao Ruofeng.

28:52.110 --> 28:53.290
Your opponent

28:54.790 --> 28:55.860
is Prince of Langya?

28:56.200 --> 28:57.090
We're far

28:57.110 --> 28:59.570
from the only one.

29:00.240 --> 29:02.770
He's too dazzling and too powerful.

29:03.680 --> 29:04.940
Worst of all,

29:05.550 --> 29:08.010
he's far too proud.

29:09.480 --> 29:10.220
So,

29:10.880 --> 29:13.140
almost all Tianqi City

29:13.880 --> 29:16.700
sees him as their rival.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.290
The whole city?

29:22.070 --> 29:22.900
Yes.

29:26.680 --> 29:27.530
His Majesty

29:28.720 --> 29:30.380
must also be

29:31.830 --> 29:33.900
losing sleep.

29:48.510 --> 29:49.010
Your Majesty,

29:49.680 --> 29:50.420
what has happened?

29:56.160 --> 29:56.770
It's nothing.

29:58.070 --> 29:59.570
I merely had a nightmare.

30:03.030 --> 30:03.570
Dreams

30:04.310 --> 30:05.050
often run contrary.

30:05.590 --> 30:06.980
No need to worry, Your Majesty.

30:07.790 --> 30:08.620
I dreamed

30:10.830 --> 30:12.700
I lay alone on a sickbed.

30:14.200 --> 30:14.980
Someone,

30:15.920 --> 30:17.010
in armor,

30:18.000 --> 30:19.940
came to my bedside with a sword.

30:21.350 --> 30:22.250
He lifted the bed-curtain

30:23.750 --> 30:25.330
and drove it through my chest.

30:26.310 --> 30:27.700
Did Your Majesty

30:28.510 --> 30:29.860
see the assassin's face?

30:33.200 --> 30:33.810
Brother,

30:34.200 --> 30:34.730
it's me.

30:35.270 --> 30:35.860
I'm here.

30:44.590 --> 30:45.140
No.

30:47.200 --> 30:47.940
I couldn't see.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.530
Each time he appears,

30:53.400 --> 30:55.330
only the blade is clear.

30:57.030 --> 30:57.730
His face

30:59.030 --> 31:00.330
is always a blur.

31:01.920 --> 31:02.940
Every time?

31:07.790 --> 31:08.460
Yes.

31:10.200 --> 31:11.330
I've had the same dream

31:12.790 --> 31:14.420
for over half a month.

31:17.440 --> 31:18.180
Leave me.

31:19.030 --> 31:19.620
Got it.

31:31.260 --> 31:35.700
[He-Yu Clinic]

31:47.350 --> 31:49.770
"He-Yu Clinic, Tianqi Branch"...

31:50.960 --> 31:51.660
Miss Bai didn't send you

31:51.680 --> 31:52.620
to set up the shop,

31:52.830 --> 31:53.620
but had you

31:53.640 --> 31:54.860
writing paper seals instead?

31:57.310 --> 31:58.660
What a waste of talent.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.250
She says

32:00.880 --> 32:02.050
since it's her clinic,

32:02.550 --> 32:04.090
it must stand out,

32:04.200 --> 32:05.220
make a name.

32:05.710 --> 32:06.570
Later,

32:06.590 --> 32:08.460
I'll write for the Nan'an branch too,

32:09.550 --> 32:11.290
like "timely care, cure on time".

32:11.640 --> 32:13.090
See it's He-Yu Clinic's medicine,

32:13.550 --> 32:14.220
and they're sure...

32:18.200 --> 32:19.330
to come back next time they're ill.

32:21.880 --> 32:23.490
That's exactly the kind of idea she'd have.

32:24.110 --> 32:25.010
Let me try one.

32:25.480 --> 32:26.220
Hand it here.

32:48.170 --> 32:48.860
How is it?

32:52.220 --> 32:52.940
[He-Yu Clinic, Tianqi Branch]

32:52.960 --> 32:56.090
Huan-liang-shao-hua...

32:57.030 --> 32:59.090
Bai-tang-xi-hua...

33:03.110 --> 33:04.090
Write it like you usually do,

33:04.110 --> 33:05.220
neat and proper.

33:05.830 --> 33:07.380
Not wild cursive like a maniac.

33:08.240 --> 33:09.380
Or when you're done tonight,

33:09.880 --> 33:10.830
watch out tomorrow

33:10.830 --> 33:12.290
for poison in your tea and food.

33:15.750 --> 33:16.380
Enough of that.

33:17.030 --> 33:17.900
Back to business.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.250
Tianqi's waters

33:21.000 --> 33:22.290
run deeper than we thought.

33:22.960 --> 33:23.700
We still can't read

33:23.720 --> 33:24.620
Prince of Langya's mind.

33:25.400 --> 33:26.010
How about this...

33:31.110 --> 33:33.380
The Yellow Springs Pawnshop's hoard's sat too long.

33:33.960 --> 33:35.140
Let it see daylight.

33:39.920 --> 33:40.420
No.

33:42.240 --> 33:42.810
Why not?

33:43.440 --> 33:44.090
Whatever side we choose,

33:44.440 --> 33:45.620
those items will be

33:45.920 --> 33:47.380
Blood River's best leverage.

33:47.790 --> 33:48.900
Even if we stay neutral,

33:49.440 --> 33:50.900
they're our shield.

34:01.510 --> 34:04.180
The Pawnshop trades with court and jianghu alike.

34:05.510 --> 34:06.980
Its holdings are priceless.

34:08.360 --> 34:09.420
If they flood the world,

34:10.030 --> 34:11.170
powers led

34:11.190 --> 34:12.090
by Baixiao Hall

34:12.150 --> 34:13.010
will start digging,

34:13.760 --> 34:14.740
tracing every lead,

34:15.030 --> 34:15.980
unraveling every clue.

34:16.880 --> 34:17.650
Blood River's past,

34:18.400 --> 34:18.860
our dealings,

34:19.150 --> 34:19.690
our grudges,

34:20.190 --> 34:21.980
could all be laid bare.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.380
The risk is far too great.

34:24.190 --> 34:25.050
Besides,

34:30.030 --> 34:30.860
an innocent man

34:31.400 --> 34:32.210
is blamed for the jade he bears.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.090
If Prince of Langya,

34:34.800 --> 34:35.460
the First Prince,

34:36.320 --> 34:37.440
even His Majesty,

34:37.440 --> 34:39.010
see those arms and treasures,

34:39.510 --> 34:40.460
Blood River will likely become

34:40.710 --> 34:41.860
everyone's target.

34:43.440 --> 34:44.610
Until things are clear,

34:45.670 --> 34:46.460
we can't touch it.

34:57.230 --> 34:57.900
All right then.

34:59.280 --> 34:59.980
Then I'll

35:01.440 --> 35:02.900
write a few more seals for practice.

35:10.620 --> 35:14.100
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:14.140 --> 35:18.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:19.860 --> 35:23.340
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:23.380 --> 35:27.220
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

35:29.220 --> 35:32.500
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

35:32.620 --> 35:34.700
♪Still I can't let go♪

35:34.860 --> 35:38.300
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

35:38.780 --> 35:40.980
♪My heart no longer my own♪

35:41.100 --> 35:46.100
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:02.700 --> 36:06.420
♪How many hidden feelings♪

36:06.540 --> 36:10.620
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

36:11.860 --> 36:15.740
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

36:15.860 --> 36:20.100
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

36:21.220 --> 36:24.100
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

36:24.180 --> 36:28.420
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

36:30.700 --> 36:34.700
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

36:34.740 --> 36:38.180
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

36:39.700 --> 36:43.140
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:43.220 --> 36:47.020
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:48.940 --> 36:52.380
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:52.420 --> 36:56.260
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

